asset:        layers-comps.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture (combined): the layer switch, layer header, composition setting, static transform, track matte and blend mode cases
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work; generation: tools/aep/GENERATING.md, case map: docs/aep/CASES.md
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file: ../LICENSE-MIT, ../LICENSE-APACHE
added:        2026-11-03 by @vangel76
notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026, driven by the generator in `tools/aep/` (one composition per case, named like the case; docs/aep/CASES.md), as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The footage links name contributor-made test media that are not included (a png image); their stored paths and the host name were replaced by neutral ones of the same length. The XMP packet after the project container was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project. Colour profile payloads removed: every embedded ICC profile (the working-space profile in the settings JSON, and the profile of imported footage) was replaced by a description-only stub made in code (tools/aep/stubicc.rs: 128-byte header, one `desc` tag with the original profile name, no colour data). The stub keeps the working-space name for metadata tests; it is not a colour-transform oracle. Final bytes checked with tools/aep/inspect-embedded.py (raw, base64 and AEPX hex): only stubs remain, no vendor strings, no personal paths or names (docs/aep/2026-11-03-initial-corpus.md).
